# Research briefs

Public GitHub Pages only. Details live in `.cursor/skills/` — do not improvise a new method.

- **Public sources only** on published HTML. No oral/family/internal gossip.
- **Tag claims:** 事實／公司自述／推論／建議／次級／衝突 (`data-kind` + visible tag).
- **No CDN.** Each brief is one self-contained `index.html` (inline CSS/JS).
- **Never invent** revenue, tonnage, named customers, or supplier deals without a URL.
- Hub cards are **independent companies**. Skills: `/company-research-report`, `/interactive-research-html`, `/public-data-osint`.
